<Layout
	title="BrandRise™ Launch Packages | Ascend Consulting"
	description="BrandRise™ is your lift-off point — a complete system that builds or rebuilds your brand's strategic, visual, verbal, and digital foundation. Choose from four upfront tiers ($3,500–$33,500+) or our $250/month BrandRise Monthly subscription with zero upfront cost — plus a $100/month Ongoing Care Plan to keep everything running."
	bare
	canonical="https://ascendsmartly.com/brandrise"
>
	<div class="min-h-screen bg-white">
		<MinimalHeader />

		<!-- Hero -->
		<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-primary pt-32 pb-20 md:pt-40 md:pb-28">
			<div class="absolute inset-0">
				<img src="/images/brandrise-hero.webp" alt="" class="h-full w-full object-cover object-center" />
				<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-primary/88"></div>
			</div>
			<div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true">
				<div class="absolute -top-[20%] -right-[10%] h-[60%] w-[60%] rounded-full bg-secondary/25 blur-[120px]"></div>
				<div class="absolute -bottom-[20%] -left-[10%] h-[50%] w-[50%] rounded-full bg-accent/15 blur-[100px]"></div>
			</div>
			<div class="container relative z-10 mx-auto px-6 text-center md:px-12">
				<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
					<div class="mb-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-white/10 px-4 py-1.5">
						<span class="h-2 w-2 animate-pulse rounded-full bg-accent"></span>
						<span class="text-sm font-medium tracking-wide text-white/80">Launch · Relaunch · Rise</span>
					</div>
					<h1 class="mb-4 text-6xl leading-[1.05] font-normal text-white md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl">
						Brand<span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-accent via-orange-300 to-yellow-300 bg-clip-text text-transparent">Rise</span><span class="align-super text-4xl text-white/40 md:text-5xl">™</span>
					</h1>
					<p class="mx-auto mb-8 max-w-2xl text-xl leading-relaxed font-light text-white/75 md:text-2xl">
						Your lift-off point — a complete system that builds or relaunches the strategic, visual, verbal, and
						digital foundation your organization needs to compete and grow.
					</p>
					<div class="mb-10 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3">
						{
							tiers.map((t) => (
								<a
									href={`#${t.id}`}
									class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold transition-all hover:scale-105"
									style={`border-color:${t.color}60; color:${t.color}; background-color:${t.color}15`}
								>
									<span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full" style={`background-color:${t.color}`} />
									{t.name} · {t.price}
								</a>
							))
						}
					</div>
					<a
						href="#pricing"
						class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-sm bg-accent px-8 py-4 text-lg font-medium text-white shadow-lg transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-accent/90 hover:shadow-xl"
						set:html={`Choose Your Tier ${ArrowRight}`}
					/>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- What Is BrandRise -->
		<section class="bg-white py-20 md:py-28">
			<div class="container mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 md:px-12">
				<div class="grid items-start gap-12 md:grid-cols-5">
					<div class="md:col-span-2">
						<p class="mb-4 text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-accent uppercase">What Is BrandRise™</p>
						<h2 class="mb-4 text-3xl leading-snug text-primary md:text-4xl">
							Built for organizations ready to rise above their competition.
						</h2>
						<div class="h-1 w-12 bg-accent"></div>
					</div>
					<div class="space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-600 md:col-span-3">
						<p>
							Whether you're starting fresh, evolving your identity, or reigniting momentum, BrandRise™ gives you
							the clarity, cohesion, and infrastructure to move forward with confidence.
						</p>
						<p>
							It's a complete suite of strategic, creative, and operational services designed to launch, refresh,
							or accelerate any organization. Each offering stands alone — but together, they form a full
							business-launch ecosystem.
						</p>
						<p>
							Five ways to launch. Transparent pricing. One clear path from where you are to where you need to
							be — including a monthly option with zero upfront cost.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="mt-12 overflow-hidden rounded-sm border border-primary/15 bg-primary/4">
					<div class="border-b border-primary/10 px-6 pt-5 pb-3">
						<p class="mb-1 text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-accent uppercase">How Every Engagement Begins</p>
						<p class="text-base leading-snug font-semibold text-primary">
							Regardless of tier, every BrandRise™ initiative starts with a free exploratory call.
						</p>
					</div>
					<div class="px-6 py-4">
						<p class="mb-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-500">
							Before a single deliverable is scoped, Ascend takes time to deeply understand your organization.
							The exploratory call covers:
						</p>
						<ul class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-6 gap-y-2.5 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3">
							{
								engagementStarters.map((item) => (
									<li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm leading-snug text-gray-600">
										<span class="mt-0.5 flex h-4 w-4 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent/15">
											<span class="block h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent" />
										</span>
										{item}
									</li>
								))
							}
						</ul>
						<p class="mt-4 text-xs leading-relaxed text-gray-400">
							No commitment required. The call is designed to give you clarity — and give Ascend everything needed
							to recommend the right tier and build a plan that actually fits.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Pricing / Tiers -->
		<section id="pricing" class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gray-950 py-20 md:py-28">
			<div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true">
				<img src="/images/frisbee-field.jpg" alt="" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover object-center opacity-[0.10] grayscale" />
				<div class="absolute top-0 left-1/4 h-[500px] w-[500px] rounded-full bg-accent/5 blur-[120px]"></div>
				<div class="absolute right-1/4 bottom-0 h-[400px] w-[400px] rounded-full bg-indigo-600/8 blur-[100px]"></div>
			</div>
			<div class="container relative z-10 mx-auto px-6 md:px-12">
				<div class="mx-auto mb-10 max-w-2xl text-center">
					<p class="mb-4 text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-accent uppercase">The Tiers</p>
					<h2 class="mb-4 text-3xl text-white md:text-4xl">Five ways. One goal.</h2>
					<p class="text-lg text-white/60">
						Launch with zero upfront cost on a monthly plan, or choose one of four upfront tiers — whichever
						fits where you are today.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="mx-auto mb-14 max-w-4xl">
					<div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-4 rounded-sm border border-white/10 bg-white/5 px-6 py-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
						<div class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-accent/30 bg-accent/15 text-accent">
							<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" set:html={iconPaths.mail} />
						</div>
						<div class="flex-1">
							<p class="mb-1 text-sm leading-snug font-semibold text-white">
								Every tier starts with a free exploratory call — no commitment required.
							</p>
							<p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-white/45">
								Before any work begins, Ascend takes time to understand your goals, current brand and
								messaging, ideal customer profile, competitive landscape, digital presence, timeline, and what
								success looks like for your organization. The right tier becomes clear from there.
							</p>
						</div>
						<a
							href={site.booking}
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener"
							class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-sm border border-accent/40 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-bold whitespace-nowrap text-accent transition-all hover:bg-accent hover:text-white"
							set:html={`Book the Call ${ArrowRight}`}
						/>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1500px] gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-5">
					{
						tiers.map((t) => (
							<div id={t.id} class="relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-sm border" style={`border-color:${t.color}66; background:linear-gradient(to bottom, ${t.color}14, transparent)`}>
								{t.popular && (
									<div class="bg-accent py-1.5 text-center text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-white uppercase">Most Popular</div>
								)}
								<div class:list={["flex flex-1 flex-col p-7", t.popular && "pt-10"]}>
									<div class="mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
										<div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full" style={`background-color:${t.color}20; border:1px solid ${t.color}40`}>
											<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke={t.color} stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" set:html={iconPaths[t.icon]} />
										</div>
										<div>
											<p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase" style={`color:${t.color}`}>{t.name}</p>
											<p class="text-xs leading-tight text-white/60">{t.label}</p>
										</div>
									</div>
									<div class="mb-5">
										<p class="mb-1 text-4xl leading-none font-bold text-white">{t.price}</p>
										<p class="text-xs text-white/40">{t.priceSubtitle}</p>
										{t.priceNote && <p class="mt-1.5 text-[10px] font-bold tracking-wider uppercase" style={`color:${t.color}`}>{t.priceNote}</p>}
									</div>
									<p class="mb-6 border-t border-white/10 pt-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/70">{t.tagline}</p>
									<ul class="mb-8 flex-1 space-y-2.5">
										{t.features.map((f) => {
											const text = typeof f === "string" ? f : f.text;
											const link = typeof f === "string" ? null : f.link;
											const linkLabel = typeof f === "string" ? null : f.linkLabel;
											const isHeader = text.startsWith("Everything");
											return (
												<li class:list={["flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm", isHeader ? "font-semibold text-white/80" : "text-white/60"]}>
													{isHeader ? (
														<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke={t.color} stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="mt-0.5 shrink-0" set:html={ArrowRight.match(/<path.*<\/path>/s)?.[0]} />
													) : (
														<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-white/30" set:html={Check.match(/<path.*<\/path>/s)?.[0]} />
													)}
													<span>
														{text}
														{link && (
															<a href={link} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="ml-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-accent/70 underline underline-offset-2 transition-colors hover:text-accent">
																{linkLabel ?? link}
															</a>
														)}
													</span>
												</li>
											);
										})}
									</ul>
									<div class="mb-6 rounded-sm border p-4" style={`background-color:${t.color}10; border-color:${t.color}40`}>
										<p class="mb-1 text-xs font-bold tracking-wider uppercase" style={`color:${t.color}`}>Outcome</p>
										<p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-white/70">{t.outcome}</p>
									</div>
									<a
										href={site.booking}
										target="_blank"
										rel="noopener"
										class="flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-sm px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-white transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5"
										style={`background-color:${t.color}`}
										set:html={`${t.ctaLabel} ${ArrowRight}`}
									/>
									<a href="/brandrise/intake" class="flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-1.5 pt-1 text-xs text-white/35 transition-colors hover:text-white/70">
										Already booked? Complete your intake form →
									</a>
								</div>
							</div>
						))
					}
				</div>

				<!-- Ongoing Care Plan -->
				<div class="mx-auto mt-14 max-w-4xl">
					<div class="rounded-sm border border-emerald-400/30 bg-emerald-500/[0.06] p-6 md:p-8">
						<div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-5 sm:flex-row">
							<div class="flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-emerald-400/30 bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-300">
								<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" set:html={iconPaths.lifeBuoy} />
							</div>
							<div class="flex-1">
								<div class="mb-2 flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-3">
									<p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-emerald-300 uppercase">Ongoing Care Plan</p>
									<span class="text-xs text-white/30">·</span>
									<p class="text-2xl leading-none text-white md:text-3xl">
										$100<span class="text-base font-normal text-white/50">/month</span>
									</p>
								</div>
								<p class="mb-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/70 md:text-base">
									Already chose <span class="font-medium text-white/90">Bronze, Silver, Gold, or Platinum</span> — or
									have an existing brand and website you want to keep running smoothly? Add the Ongoing Care Plan
									for hosting, monthly updates, two seasonal refreshes a year, basic SEO upkeep, and a professional
									email setup — all for one predictable monthly fee.
								</p>
								<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1.5 text-[11px] font-bold tracking-wider text-emerald-300/80 uppercase">
									<span>$100 / month</span>
									<span class="text-white/20">·</span>
									<span>2-year minimum</span>
									<span class="text-white/20">·</span>
									<span>Add-on or standalone</span>
								</div>
							</div>
							<a
								href={site.booking}
								target="_blank"
								rel="noopener"
								class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-sm border border-emerald-400/50 px-4 py-2.5 text-xs font-bold whitespace-nowrap text-emerald-300 transition-all hover:bg-emerald-500 hover:text-white"
								set:html={`Discuss the Care Plan ${ArrowRight}`}
							/>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<p class="mx-auto mt-10 max-w-xl text-center text-sm text-white/40">
					Not sure which path is right for you?{" "}
					<a href="/brandrise/intake" class="text-accent underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-accent/80">Schedule a free consultation</a>{" "}
					and we'll figure it out together.
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- What Happens Next -->
		<section class="border-t border-gray-100 bg-white py-16 md:py-20">
			<div class="container mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 md:px-12">
				<p class="mb-3 text-center text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-accent uppercase">What Happens Next</p>
				<h2 class="mb-10 text-center text-2xl text-primary md:text-3xl">Three steps to get started.</h2>
				<div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
					{
						steps.map((s) => (
							<div class="relative flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-sm border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 p-7">
								<span class="text-4xl leading-none font-bold text-primary/10 select-none">{s.step}</span>
								<div>
									<h3 class="mb-2 text-base font-semibold text-primary">{s.title}</h3>
									<p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-500">{s.body}</p>
								</div>
								{s.cta && (
									<a
										href={s.cta.href}
										target={s.cta.external ? "_blank" : undefined}
										rel={s.cta.external ? "noopener" : undefined}
										class="mt-auto inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-accent transition-colors hover:text-accent/80"
										set:html={`${s.cta.label} ${ArrowRight}`}
									/>
								)}
							</div>
						))
					}
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- The Work -->
		<section class="border-t border-gray-100 bg-gray-50 py-20 md:py-28">
			<div class="container mx-auto px-6 md:px-12">
				<div class="mx-auto mb-14 max-w-2xl text-center">
					<p class="mb-4 text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-accent uppercase">The Work</p>
					<h2 class="mb-4 text-3xl text-primary md:text-4xl">Eight service categories. One ecosystem.</h2>
					<p class="text-lg text-gray-500">
						Every upfront BrandRise™ launch tier draws from these eight core service areas. The BrandRise Monthly
						plan focuses on website, hosting, email, and ongoing support. Click any card to see exactly what's
						included.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="mx-auto grid max-w-5xl gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
					{
						workCategories.map((service) => (
							<details class="group overflow-hidden rounded-sm border border-gray-100 bg-white shadow-sm">
								<summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start gap-5 p-6 text-left transition-colors hover:bg-gray-50">
									<div class="mt-0.5 flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-sm bg-primary/5 text-primary">
										<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" set:html={iconPaths[service.icon]} />
									</div>
									<div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
										<p class="mb-1 text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-accent uppercase">{service.num}</p>
										<h3 class="text-base leading-snug font-bold text-primary">{service.title}</h3>
										<p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-500">{service.desc}</p>
									</div>
									<div class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-gray-400">
										<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="transition-transform group-open:rotate-180"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6" /></svg>
									</div>
								</summary>
								<div class="border-t border-gray-50 px-6 pb-6">
									<ul class="mt-4 space-y-2">
										{service.items.map((item) => (
											<li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm text-gray-600">
												<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-accent" set:html={Check.match(/<path.*<\/path>/s)?.[0]} />
												{item}
											</li>
										))}
									</ul>
									<div class="mt-5 border-t border-gray-100 pt-4">
										<p class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary">
											<span class="text-accent">Outcome:</span> {service.outcome}
										</p>
									</div>
								</div>
							</details>
						))
					}
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Final CTA -->
		<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-primary py-20 md:py-28">
			<div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true">
				<div class="absolute -top-[20%] -right-[10%] h-[60%] w-[60%] rounded-full bg-secondary/25 blur-[120px]"></div>
				<div class="absolute -bottom-[20%] -left-[10%] h-[50%] w-[50%] rounded-full bg-accent/15 blur-[100px]"></div>
			</div>
			<div class="container relative z-10 mx-auto px-6 md:px-12">
				<div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
					<p class="mb-4 text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-accent uppercase">Start Your Rise</p>
					<h2 class="mb-6 text-3xl leading-snug text-white md:text-4xl">Which rise is right for you?</h2>
					<p class="mb-10 text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/70">
						Whether you're building from scratch, refreshing your identity, or preparing for your next chapter,
						BrandRise™ gives you a clear path forward — from essential foundations to full-scale transformation.
						Choose your tier. Start your rise.
					</p>
					<div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 sm:flex-row">
						<a
							href={site.booking}
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener"
							class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-sm bg-accent px-8 py-4 text-lg font-medium text-white shadow-md transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-accent/90 hover:shadow-lg sm:w-auto"
							set:html={`Schedule Your BrandRise™ Consultation ${ArrowRight}`}
						/>
					</div>
					<div class="mt-4 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 sm:flex-row">
						<a href={`mailto:${site.email}`} class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-sm text-white/60 transition-colors hover:text-white">
							<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" set:html={iconPaths.mail} />
							{site.email}
						</a>
						<span class="hidden text-white/30 sm:block">·</span>
						<span class="text-sm text-white/60">{site.phoneDisplay}</span>
					</div>
					<p class="mt-8 text-sm text-white/35">
						Already have your call booked?{" "}
						<a href="/brandrise/intake" class="text-white/55 underline underline-offset-2 transition-colors hover:text-white">Complete the pre-call intake form</a>{" "}
						so Brad can prepare.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<SolutionFooter />
	</div>
</Layout>
